1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,191
Hospitality means helping people

2
00:00:03,191 --> 00:00:06,491
feel welcome, safe and comfortable.

3
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:10,123
Say hello in a way

4
00:00:10,123 --> 00:00:12,872
that works for you.

5
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:17,806
Ask, How can I help?

6
00:00:17,806 --> 00:00:21,892
Then give the guest time to respond.

7
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,819
A kind welcome

8
00:00:24,819 --> 00:00:27,452
can make a difference.

